%% Session Instance Lifecycle — Madar V1
%% Authority: Descriptive. Source of truth: docs/03-domain/lifecycles.md
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Planned
    Planned --> Open: teacher starts session
    Open --> Closed: teacher closes session
    Closed --> Reopened: explicit correction
    Reopened --> Closed: correction done
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Open
        Attendance & recitation
        captured here
    end note
    note right of Reopened
        Same occurrence re-opened.
        Does NOT create a new session.
        Fired notifications are not retracted.
    end note
